---
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="inicio" class="relative isolate bg-gradient-to-b from-vidalia-ivory to-white">
  <!-- Portada: la fachada de fondo, con velo azul a la izquierda para que el texto se lea. -->
  <div class="relative isolate overflow-hidden">
    <img
      src="/img/fachada-vidalia.webp"
      alt=""
      width="1200"
      height="800"
      fetchpriority="high"
      data-hero-bg
      class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 -z-20 h-[115%] w-full object-cover object-[60%_center] lg:object-center"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-vidalia-deep/70 lg:bg-transparent lg:bg-gradient-to-r lg:from-vidalia-deep/90 lg:via-vidalia-deep/55 lg:to-vidalia-deep/0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 -z-10 h-32 bg-gradient-to-t from-vidalia-deep/50 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-20 pb-40 sm:pt-28 sm:pb-48 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-56">
      <header data-reveal-stagger class="max-w-2xl text-white">
        <a href={SITE.phoneHref} class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium backdrop-blur transition hover:bg-white/20">
          <span class="relative flex size-2.5">
            <span class="absolute inline-flex size-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative inline-flex size-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
          </span>
          Agentes <span class="hidden sm:inline">Funerarios</span> disponibles ahora · 24/7
        </a>
        <p class="font-script text-2xl text-vidalia-gold sm:text-3xl">{SITE.slogan}</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-[1.1] font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.4rem]">
          Funeraria en Colima: atención inmediata 24/7 y previsión funeraria
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/85">
          Somos un lugar cálido, precio claro y un acompañamiento que no termina con la despedida.
        </p>
      </header>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto -mt-28 max-w-7xl px-4 pb-16 sm:-mt-36 lg:-mt-40 lg:pb-24">
    <!-- Dos caminos: el oscuro es urgencia (hoy), el claro es previsión (para dejarlo resuelto). -->
    <div data-reveal-stagger class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <article data-spotlight class="relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-vidalia-gold/40 bg-vidalia-deep p-8 text-white shadow-soft sm:p-10">
        <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 size-64 rounded-full bg-vidalia-gold/10 blur-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-vidalia-gold uppercase">
          Atención inmediata <span class="text-white/40">·</span> <span class="font-medium text-white/70 normal-case tracking-normal">Servicio Funerario</span>
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl leading-tight font-bold sm:text-4xl">¿Perdiste a un ser Amado? Estamos contigo ahora.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-white/75">
          Un Agente Funerario te atiende de inmediato, a cualquier hora, y te da el precio claro y por escrito antes de empezar.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="ph-fill ph-clock text-lg text-vidalia-gold" aria-hidden="true"></i> Disponibles 24/7</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="ph-fill ph-flower-lotus text-lg text-vidalia-gold" aria-hidden="true"></i> Velación y Cremación</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><i class="ph-fill ph-files text-lg text-vidalia-gold" aria-hidden="true"></i> Te apoyamos con los trámites</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-auto grid gap-3 pt-8 sm:grid-cols-[1.45fr_1fr]">
          <a href={SITE.phoneHref} class="btn bg-vidalia-gold whitespace-nowrap text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-vidalia-blue">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-phone-call" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Llamar Ahora · {SITE.phone}
          </a>
          <a href={SITE.inmediatoHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn border border-white/30 text-white shadow-none hover:bg-white hover:text-vidalia-blue">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-whatsapp-logo" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article data-spotlight class="relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-vidalia-gold/40 bg-white p-8 shadow-soft sm:p-10">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-vidalia-gold uppercase">
          Previsión funeraria <span class="text-vidalia-blue/30">·</span> <span class="font-medium text-vidalia-blue/60 normal-case tracking-normal">Paquete Funerario</span>
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl leading-tight font-bold text-vidalia-blue sm:text-4xl">
          Déjalo resuelto hoy, <span class="font-script font-normal text-vidalia-gold">con calma y con amor.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 flex items-baseline gap-2 text-vidalia-blue">
          <span class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">$238</span>
          <span class="text-lg font-semibold">a la quincena</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-vidalia-blue/75">
          Paquete Vidalia · 4 años · sin intereses ni comisiones · precio congelado mientras vayas al corriente.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto grid gap-3 pt-8 sm:grid-cols-[1.45fr_1fr]">
          <a href={SITE.contratarHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn bg-vidalia-blue text-white hover:bg-vidalia-deep">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-signature" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Contratar en línea
          </a>
          <a href={SITE.whatsappHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn border border-vidalia-gold bg-white text-vidalia-blue hover:bg-vidalia-gold hover:text-white">
            <i class="ph-bold ph-whatsapp-logo" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
